# Third-party runtime DLLs collected by windows/tools/collect-lgpl-runtime.ps1.
#
# Why they are not committed: the 33 files add up to ~56 MB and are pure build products of the
# MSYS2 / FFmpeg toolchain on one machine; the repository only ever needs them inside a packaged
# LGPL build. Their identity is recorded, not their bytes: see runtime-dependencies-collected.txt
# in this directory (name, size, sha256, source) and windows/docs/LGPL-ENGINE-SWITCH.md.
#
# libmpv-2.dll itself stays tracked because the W5 evidence (windows/docs/licensing/W5-LGPL-BUILD.md,
# README.md) refers to that exact candidate by hash. Re-run the collector after any engine rebuild:
#   pwsh -File windows/tools/collect-lgpl-runtime.ps1
*.dll
!libmpv-2.dll
